WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.577
Now let's start with AND AND means every connected
condition must be

00:00:05.602 --> 00:00:10.385
satisfied Here our rule says that the patient must
be active the

00:00:10.398 --> 00:00:13.439
age must be greater than or equal to forty and the
severity

00:00:13.465 --> 00:00:18.040
must be High Notice how each additional AND
condition makes the result

00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:23.801
more restrictive Below the explanation we have a SQL
code cell

00:00:24.704 --> 00:00:28.171
You can click Run and execute this query directly in
the browser

00:00:29.073 --> 00:00:32.372
After it runs look at the result and check whether
every returned

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:38.466
row satisfies all three conditions You can also
click Copy open pgAdmin

00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:41.945
paste the query into the Query Tool and run exactly
the same

00:00:41.971 --> 00:00:46.070
SQL there When reading the WHERE clause say it as a
sentence

00:00:46.276 --> 00:00:49.099
keep records where the patient is active and age is
at least

00:00:49.111 --> 00:00:50.838
forty and severity is High
